  "bottomContent": "<div id=\"seo-intro\" style=\"padding:8px 0 0;\">\n    <h1 style=\"font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(26px,6vw,46px);letter-spacing:3px;line-height:1.1;background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--accent),var(--accent2));-webkit-background-clip:text;-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;background-clip:text;margin:16px 0 10px;\">Hangman Online</h1>\n    <p style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;\"><strong style=\"color:var(--text);\">Hangman</strong> is the classic word guessing game — now playable online with friends, family or your team, for free, on any device. No signup, no download.</p>\n    <p style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:8px;\">One player picks a secret word, everyone else guesses letters. Each wrong guess adds a part to the gallows. <strong style=\"color:var(--text);\">7 wrong guesses and it's game over</strong> — can you solve the word in time? Works for <strong style=\"color:var(--text);\">2-10 players</strong>.</p>\n    <p style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:16px;\">A brilliant <strong style=\"color:var(--text);\">educational and ice breaker game</strong> for kids from age 8 and adults alike. Perfect for online classes, team meetings, family game nights or playing with friends across different cities.</p>\n    <div style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-bottom:20px;\"><span style=\"background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;padding:4px 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);\">🪢 2-10 players</span><span style=\"background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;padding:4px 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);\">👶 Ages 8+</span><span style=\"background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;padding:4px 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);\">🆓 Free to play</span><span style=\"background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;padding:4px 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);\">📱 Mobile friendly</span><span style=\"background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:20px;padding:4px 12px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--muted);\">📚 Educational</span></div>\n  </div>\n<script>\n  (function() {\n    // SEO intro sits below the game — no injection needed, stays in natural position\n    var intro = document.getElementById('seo-intro');\n    if (intro) intro.style.display = 'block';\n  })();\n</script>\n<div style=\"max-width:780px;margin:0 auto;padding:32px 16px 16px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);margin-top:16px;\">\n  <h2 style=\"font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:22px;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--accent2);margin-bottom:12px;\">How to Play Hangman Online</h2>\n  <p style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:16px;\">The <strong style=\"color:var(--text);\">word picker</strong> types a secret word. Everyone else guesses letters by clicking the keyboard. Each correct letter is revealed in the word. Each wrong letter adds a body part to the gallows. <strong style=\"color:var(--text);\">7 wrong guesses</strong> ends the round.</p>\n  <h2 style=\"font-family:'Bebas Neue',sans-serif;font-size:22px;letter-spacing:2px;color:var(--accent2);margin-bottom:12px;\">Who Is This Game For?</h2>\n  <p style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:14px;line-height:1.8;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:16px;\">Hangman online is perfect for kids learning new vocabulary, adults who enjoy word games, team building sessions and anyone who wants a quick fun game that works on any device without any setup.</p>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;padding-top:16px;border-top:1px solid var(--border);\">\n    <a href=\"/wisielec\" style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;\">🇵🇱 Wisielec</a><a href=\"/galgenmaennchen-online\" style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;\">🇩🇪 Galgenmännchen</a><a href=\"/hanga-gubbe-online\" style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;\">🇸🇪 Hänga gubbe</a><a href=\"/how-to-play/hangman\" style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;\">📖 Game Rules</a><a href=\"/games\" style=\"color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;\">🎮 All Games</a>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<script src=\"/socket.io/socket.io.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"/js/shared.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"/js/hangman-words.js\"></script>\n<script src=\"/js/hangman-client.js\"></script>\n<script>\n// Override setUiLang on SEO pages — navigate to language-specific URL\n// instead of translating in place (keeps URL consistent with language)\nwindow._seoLangUrls = {'pl':'/wisielec', 'en':'/hangman-online', 'de':'/galgenmaennchen-online', 'sv':'/hanga-gubbe-online'};\n(function() {{\n  var _origSetUiLang = null;\n  function _seoSetUiLang(code) {{\n    var url = window._seoLangUrls[code];\n    if (url) {{\n      window.location.href = url;\n    }} else if (_origSetUiLang) {{\n      _origSetUiLang(code);\n    }}\n  }}\n  // Wait for game client to define setUiLang, then override it\n  var _attempts = 0;\n  function _tryOverride() {{\n    if (typeof setUiLang === 'function' && setUiLang !== _seoSetUiLang) {{\n      _origSetUiLang = setUiLang;\n      setUiLang = _seoSetUiLang;\n      window.setUiLang = _seoSetUiLang;\n      // Rebuild lang bar so buttons use new setUiLang\n      if (typeof buildLangBar === 'function') buildLangBar();\n    }} else if (_attempts++ < 20) {{\n      setTimeout(_tryOverride, 100);\n    }}\n  }}\n  _tryOverride();\n}})();\n</script>"
